WEBVTT

00:00:01.110 --> 00:00:08.290
Stepping out on
an ordinary Sunday

00:00:08.290 --> 00:00:14.790
Stepping out!
A miracle's gonna happen

00:00:14.790 --> 00:00:16.630
It's my day!

00:00:22.730 --> 00:00:27.200
Maybe I'll throw off my pajamas

00:00:29.670 --> 00:00:34.610
and head out to see her right now

00:00:36.580 --> 00:00:41.990
I always turned my eyes away,
thinking she'd hate me

00:00:43.650 --> 00:00:49.390
Now I'm saying goodbye
to that negative attitude

00:00:50.590 --> 00:00:55.170
My favorite shoes
will always take me

00:00:57.670 --> 00:01:02.310
To a place where I'll be happy

00:01:04.470 --> 00:01:09.810
It's not someone else
I want to embrace

00:01:11.510 --> 00:01:15.950
But a version of
myself that's not fake

00:01:15.950 --> 00:01:19.020
I just want to walk

00:01:19.360 --> 00:01:22.560
Not on tip-toe

00:01:22.790 --> 00:01:26.530
Not downcast, either

00:01:27.500 --> 00:01:35.440
Just I'm stepping out
on an ordinary Sunday

00:01:35.440 --> 00:01:41.880
Stepping out!
Making a little try, try, try

00:01:41.880 --> 00:01:44.150
It's my day!

00:02:00.560 --> 00:02:01.270
Tsukushi...

00:02:09.940 --> 00:02:10.640
Tsukasa!

00:02:13.710 --> 00:02:14.280
Let go!

00:02:15.010 --> 00:02:16.910
If you leave now, you'll also...

00:02:18.810 --> 00:02:21.790
I'm going to save her. I swear I will.

00:02:33.260 --> 00:02:35.500
<i>I can't feel my hands or feet...</i>

00:02:36.730 --> 00:02:38.900
<i>Am I going to die?</i>

00:02:41.100 --> 00:02:49.910
"His Body Against Mine!"

00:02:58.450 --> 00:03:00.220
<i>Makino... Where are you?</i>

00:03:01.520 --> 00:03:05.390
<i>Die? I don't want to die here...</i>

00:03:06.090 --> 00:03:09.230
<i>I have dreams... to realize.</i>

00:03:19.070 --> 00:03:20.970
<i>I'll graduate from Eitoku Academy</i>

00:03:21.740 --> 00:03:25.110
<i>and I'll be free to do whatever I want.</i>

00:03:51.770 --> 00:03:54.840
<i>I'll get a good office job and work hard.</i>

00:03:56.010 --> 00:04:00.580
<i>After work, I'll hang out with co-workers
to eat and drink and talk.</i>

00:04:08.150 --> 00:04:08.720
Damn!

00:04:15.090 --> 00:04:18.660
<i>I'll buy presents for Mom and Dad
with my bonuses...</i>

00:04:19.600 --> 00:04:21.630
<i>and I'll get myself some clothes.</i>

00:04:35.310 --> 00:04:36.550
Makino!

00:05:09.040 --> 00:05:12.790
LOUSY FOOL

00:05:48.450 --> 00:05:50.180
<i>Then, I'll fall in love...</i>

00:05:56.320 --> 00:05:59.690
<i>...and pledge eternal devotion
to the man of my dreams.</i>

00:06:13.840 --> 00:06:15.210
<i>A wonderful kiss...</i>

00:06:16.140 --> 00:06:19.080
<i>So warm... and so gentle...</i>

00:06:35.690 --> 00:06:38.230
<i>What?! Domyoji?</i>

00:06:49.710 --> 00:06:50.910
Are you conscious?

00:06:53.540 --> 00:06:54.550
Why...?

00:06:54.550 --> 00:06:57.310
You moron! I thought you were dead!

00:06:57.880 --> 00:07:00.130
What about Yuki?

00:07:00.620 --> 00:07:03.290
Don't worry. She's at the villa.
I'll explain later.

00:07:17.870 --> 00:07:22.970
<i>His chest is so warm...
So warm and so gentle...</i>

00:07:25.090 --> 00:07:26.840
Idiot! Don't fall asleep!

00:07:27.240 --> 00:07:28.860
Ouch!

00:07:29.710 --> 00:07:31.280
We're not far from a cabin.

00:07:31.750 --> 00:07:32.760
Stay awake till we get there.

00:07:47.260 --> 00:07:49.870
Let's wait out the blizzard here.

00:07:50.770 --> 00:07:52.840
The snowmobile broke down.

00:07:55.850 --> 00:08:00.010
You sprained your ankle?
What an idiot! Sit there.

00:08:03.010 --> 00:08:05.230
Domyoji... I'm cold...

00:08:07.520 --> 00:08:10.200
Hang on... I'll try and find something
to start a fire.

00:08:18.890 --> 00:08:19.580
We're in luck.

00:08:24.400 --> 00:08:25.200
Damn!

00:08:27.840 --> 00:08:29.230
I thought I would die.

00:08:29.230 --> 00:08:30.840
If I'd been any later, you might have.

00:08:31.670 --> 00:08:32.770
Here we go...

00:08:38.680 --> 00:08:41.950
This sucks... you saved my life.

00:08:44.950 --> 00:08:46.890
I owe you again.

00:08:52.260 --> 00:08:54.290
Quit babbling, will you?

00:09:01.570 --> 00:09:04.500
You don't owe me anything.

00:09:15.310 --> 00:09:16.780
Hurry up and
take off your clothes, too.

00:09:17.450 --> 00:09:18.180
What?!

00:09:18.550 --> 00:09:20.820
You'll never warm up if you keep
that wet sweater on.

00:09:21.550 --> 00:09:23.540
I-I'm fine...

00:09:24.220 --> 00:09:25.790
This is no time to be embarrassed.

00:09:26.130 --> 00:09:29.050
Look at your feet.
They're nearly frostbitten.

00:09:38.970 --> 00:09:40.670
Don't stare, okay?

00:09:43.280 --> 00:09:44.460
Take off your bottom, too.

00:09:45.110 --> 00:09:47.350
What?! Absolutely not!

00:09:48.380 --> 00:09:51.820
It's up to you. You're the one
who's going to freeze.

00:09:53.590 --> 00:09:56.620
Domyoji...
don't get any ideas, okay?

00:10:02.830 --> 00:10:04.630
Is this really the time for that?!

00:10:06.160 --> 00:10:08.500
I-I'm sorry, I...

00:10:10.100 --> 00:10:11.760
Never mind. Come sit by the fire.

00:10:21.710 --> 00:10:23.450
Let's just go to sleep.

00:10:26.980 --> 00:10:29.620
Your body's so cold. You're like ice.

00:10:31.890 --> 00:10:32.820
So warm...

00:10:34.160 --> 00:10:34.930
Of course...

00:10:35.460 --> 00:10:37.090
You're soaking up my body heat.

00:10:37.890 --> 00:10:42.790
I never knew that someone's body heat
could feel so good.

00:10:44.000 --> 00:10:47.600
Domyoji... You're a nice guy, aren't you?

00:10:48.100 --> 00:10:51.070
Being called a "nice guy"
doesn't even make me happy.

00:10:51.610 --> 00:10:53.300
I'd rather you called me
a gentleman.

00:10:54.910 --> 00:10:59.850
You're far from a gentleman, but
you're so nice and warm.

00:11:06.290 --> 00:11:09.290
This girl... she pisses me off...

00:13:00.000 --> 00:13:01.030
What's that sound?

00:13:13.040 --> 00:13:16.510
What? What's that noise?

00:13:19.880 --> 00:13:21.550
What are you looking at?

00:13:37.940 --> 00:13:38.860
Listen...

00:13:39.970 --> 00:13:42.600
Quit crying, will you?
They're just breasts.

00:13:43.440 --> 00:13:45.410
Just breasts... Well, pardon me!

00:13:45.410 --> 00:13:48.780
My heart isn't made of steel wool,
like yours.

00:13:49.850 --> 00:13:52.110
Nice way to talk to your savior!

00:13:55.350 --> 00:13:58.620
Come to think of it,
I haven't even been thanked yet.

00:13:59.090 --> 00:14:00.190
Fine!

00:14:02.630 --> 00:14:03.620
Thanks.

00:14:09.630 --> 00:14:14.100
Seriously, I thought my steel-wool heart
would stop, too.

00:14:16.440 --> 00:14:18.940
Don't make me worry so much.

00:14:25.510 --> 00:14:26.220
Okay.

00:14:40.500 --> 00:14:41.260
Tsukasa!

00:14:42.330 --> 00:14:43.470
Makino!

00:14:46.730 --> 00:14:47.740
Tsukushi!

00:14:51.010 --> 00:14:52.010
I'm so glad!

00:14:52.940 --> 00:14:55.710
I'm sorry for worrying you.

00:14:56.580 --> 00:14:58.080
Such a reckless thing...

00:15:07.320 --> 00:15:08.660
W-welcome back...

00:15:12.230 --> 00:15:13.960
You... I heard all about it.

00:15:23.370 --> 00:15:25.240
Go back to Japan, all of you!

00:15:29.480 --> 00:15:30.510
Domyoji!

00:15:32.110 --> 00:15:35.010
It's okay. It's okay...

00:15:42.890 --> 00:15:44.660
They regret it so much, they're crying.

00:15:46.630 --> 00:15:48.360
We're not crying...

00:15:50.860 --> 00:15:53.000
You're such a fool.

00:16:00.840 --> 00:16:03.470
Come on, come on!
Hurry it up, will you?

00:16:04.110 --> 00:16:07.680
Makino and Domyoji are both hungry
and they're waiting!

00:16:13.350 --> 00:16:16.250
Come on... Can't you even fry an egg?

00:16:16.820 --> 00:16:19.460
I've never cooked before.

00:16:22.230 --> 00:16:23.430
Oh, Makino!

00:16:24.900 --> 00:16:27.730
Um... Don't be too hard on them.

00:16:28.670 --> 00:16:30.440
You're too kindhearted.

00:16:31.470 --> 00:16:35.170
If it were me, I'd hang them out
in minus 15-degree weather

00:16:35.170 --> 00:16:37.240
and make icicles out of them.

00:16:38.510 --> 00:16:40.340
<i>I wouldn't be surprised if she did it.</i>

00:16:41.550 --> 00:16:44.520
We'll gladly cook you breakfast...
or anything!

00:16:46.220 --> 00:16:47.480
That's the attitude!

00:16:48.620 --> 00:16:51.260
When you're done here,
make the beds.

00:16:57.560 --> 00:17:00.830
So... where did you 
two spend the night?

00:17:04.100 --> 00:17:05.810
Maybe in a cabin...

00:17:05.810 --> 00:17:09.670
where you stripped down
and warmed each other up? No way, right?

00:17:13.640 --> 00:17:15.080
Y-you did?

00:17:15.450 --> 00:17:15.990
Shut up!

00:17:15.990 --> 00:17:16.950
You're wrong!

00:17:18.280 --> 00:17:21.250
The truth always comes out, you know.

00:17:27.890 --> 00:17:29.830
Did the two go all the way?

00:17:29.830 --> 00:17:31.460
Of course not!

00:17:39.500 --> 00:17:41.500
Take a nice long rest, Tsukushi.

00:17:41.870 --> 00:17:42.470
I will...

00:17:43.440 --> 00:17:44.170
Ouch!

00:17:44.170 --> 00:17:46.480
Hey, your leg all right?

00:17:49.610 --> 00:17:50.280
Y-yes!

00:18:06.760 --> 00:18:09.730
Why are you staring at each other?

00:18:10.700 --> 00:18:12.500
We're not staring at each other!

00:18:13.100 --> 00:18:15.470
Wow! You're totally in sync!

00:18:28.250 --> 00:18:31.050
It's hard to hate
someone like Domyoji, isn't it?

00:18:51.170 --> 00:18:54.680
<i>It's so embarrassing! 
I want to forget fast!</i>

00:19:13.760 --> 00:19:14.490
<i>Right!</i>

00:19:18.730 --> 00:19:20.330
My...

00:19:24.440 --> 00:19:25.270
How pretty!

00:19:26.070 --> 00:19:28.510
Fireworks are pretty in the snow,
aren't they?

00:19:28.510 --> 00:19:30.440
Yes. Beautiful.

00:19:47.860 --> 00:19:48.790
Makino...

00:19:52.930 --> 00:19:53.600
Hey...

00:19:53.970 --> 00:19:54.700
What is it?

00:19:55.470 --> 00:19:56.230
Come with me.

00:20:01.170 --> 00:20:02.970
Domyoji, where are we going?

00:20:05.280 --> 00:20:06.080
Makino...

00:20:07.910 --> 00:20:09.410
What is it?

00:20:12.250 --> 00:20:13.750
Let's settle things.

00:20:17.850 --> 00:20:19.460
Settle what things?

00:20:19.820 --> 00:20:20.990
Well...

00:20:21.630 --> 00:20:22.960
Oh! <i>That</i> thing.

00:20:23.760 --> 00:20:26.100
That...? You know what I mean?

00:20:27.160 --> 00:20:30.400
I was thinking that I should tell you
right out, too.

00:20:31.730 --> 00:20:35.060
Really? Well, it doesn't 
matter to me, but...

00:20:35.060 --> 00:20:38.150
if you insist on going steady, I...

00:20:38.740 --> 00:20:41.430
When I get back to Japan,
I'll pay you back... one million yen...

00:20:41.430 --> 00:20:43.150
even if I need to
take on more jobs.

00:20:43.550 --> 00:20:44.080
Huh?

00:20:48.780 --> 00:20:50.790
You're so dumb!
There's no hope for you.

00:20:53.320 --> 00:20:55.790
I told you, you don't owe me anything.

00:20:57.890 --> 00:20:58.670
I...

00:21:00.060 --> 00:21:01.170
I-I'm telling you...

00:21:02.060 --> 00:21:03.470
I love you!

00:21:05.470 --> 00:21:08.100
What?! I can't hear you!

00:21:20.850 --> 00:21:21.980
What did you say?

00:21:21.980 --> 00:21:23.190
Shut up and wait.

00:21:28.290 --> 00:21:29.580
I LOVE YOU

00:21:29.580 --> 00:21:32.290
Okay, I'm ready. Look at this.

00:21:32.790 --> 00:21:35.720
Oh... A shooting star!

00:21:35.720 --> 00:21:36.600
Beautiful!

00:21:36.760 --> 00:21:38.700
I LOVE YOU

00:21:42.200 --> 00:21:44.340
<i>I hope I'll be able to pay off
the loan quickly.</i>

00:21:44.640 --> 00:21:45.370
<i>And...</i>

00:21:47.710 --> 00:21:49.840
<i>I hope, one day,
my dreams will come true.</i>

00:22:04.390 --> 00:22:10.460
You let your hair down a little

00:22:12.430 --> 00:22:18.340
You hid the fact
that you were crying

00:22:20.110 --> 00:22:28.210
I noticed, but I
couldn't ask you why

00:22:28.450 --> 00:22:36.260
I can never be
honest about how I feel

00:22:36.260 --> 00:22:44.030
Until after we've split
up after a bad fight

00:22:44.300 --> 00:22:52.170
I can say it now,
though, over and over

00:22:44.300 --> 00:22:52.170
(Sorry girl, I was
wrong and I love you)

00:22:52.170 --> 00:23:00.550
I can say "I love you"...

00:22:52.170 --> 00:23:00.550
(Sorry girl, I was
wrong and I love you)

00:23:02.350 --> 00:23:10.320
Do you really hate me this time?

00:23:10.320 --> 00:23:18.100
Will you end up running to him?

00:23:18.360 --> 00:23:26.270
I can say it now,
though, over and over

00:23:18.360 --> 00:23:26.270
(Sorry girl, I was
wrong and I love you)

00:23:26.270 --> 00:23:34.680
I can say "I love you"...

00:23:26.270 --> 00:23:34.680
(Sorry girl, I was
wrong and I love you)

00:23:48.220 --> 00:23:51.360
A mysterious boy appears
from nowhere: Junpei Oribe.

00:23:52.300 --> 00:23:55.100
Makino, you are my goddess of victory.

00:23:55.700 --> 00:23:57.200
His smile is carefree...

00:23:57.430 --> 00:24:00.200
But he seems to have some secret.

00:24:00.740 --> 00:24:03.510
Hana Yori Dango: 
"Do You Want a Friend?"

00:24:04.340 --> 00:24:08.010
How can he call the F4 fools,
right on campus?!
